  Mitani, Keiko. “Intertextuality in Medieval Slavonic Literature: Apocalypse of Pseudo-Methodius and The Legend of the Twelve Fridays.” <title level="m">Scripta &amp; E-Scripta</title> 19 (2019): 145–64.
